给变化，留一格 / Room for Change
Original fictional narrative, graphic geometry, code animation, procedural music and Foley created for the user. No upstream footage, narration, score or source animation code is reused.

Style reference: Lemo-Opuscar / Swiss Motion Graphics
https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar/blob/main/styles/swiss-motion/STYLE.md
Reference is used for design grammar only. Reference video is not redistributed.

Fonts: Noto Sans CJK SC / Noto Sans SC, Regular and Bold
Source: installed fonts-noto-cjk system package; original project https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk
License: SIL Open Font License 1.1; complete license and attribution in assets/font-license.txt.
Supplied OTF files are glyph subsets made from font index 2 (Simplified Chinese) of the installed collections. No external font request occurs during rendering.

Audio: All musical notes, percussion, paper slides, mechanical clacks and ambience generated from original deterministic synthesis. No recorded sample library, external music, TTS, voice clone, or paid generation service used.

Tools used: existing @napi-rs/canvas (0.1.100), Node.js, NumPy, SciPy, Pillow, FontTools and FFmpeg. Their runtime code is not bundled in this source package.
